<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37979" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπάλλ-αξις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>interweaving</i> or <i>dovetailing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antipho Soph.
				20
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ἐ. τοῦ χάρακος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					18.18.11
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐ. τῶν δακτύλων</span>
			<i>crossing</i> of two fingers so as to feel double, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1011a33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Insomn.</u>
				460b20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pr.</u>
				958b14
			</span></i>; <i>linking together,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				387a12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>overlapping</i> of species, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>GA</u>
				732b15
			</span></i>; <i>confusion</i> of different things, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				12.8.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>alternation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				240c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>change,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hierocl.
					<u>in CA</u>
					1p.419M.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαιτημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					6.59
				</span></i>
			 (pl.); <i>varieties</i> of abnormal constitutions, ib.<i><span class="en">
				385
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
